f(t)+96K\,\mathbb EC(t)=f(0),\qquad
f'(t)=-96K\,\operatorname{Tr}(\Gamma\rho_t).
\]
This agrees with PRE, including all field/number/charge coherences. It concerns the baseline evolved preparation at time t and its zero-lag probe; it is not a finite-lag attenuation formula.

